BT 1 0 0 1 5 86.5 Tm /F4 7 Tf 8.5 TL (BEGIN) Tj T* (  READ text) Tj T* (  text = lowercase\(text\)) Tj T* (  replace punctuation with spaces) Tj T* (  words = split\(text\)) Tj T* (  counts = empty dictionary) Tj T* (  FOR each word in words:) Tj T* (    counts[word] = counts.get\(word, 0\) + 1) Tj T* (  FOR each word and count:) Tj T* (    IF count > 1: DISPLAY word and count) Tj T* (END) Tj T* ET
