BT 1 0 0 1 5 78 Tm /F4 7 Tf 8.5 TL (BEGIN) Tj T* (  FOR each day, prepared, served) Tj T* (    IF prepared <= 0 OR served < 0 OR served > prepared:) Tj T* (      DISPLAY invalid record) Tj T* (    ELSE) Tj T* (      leftovers = prepared - served) Tj T* (      waste_percent = leftovers / prepared * 100) Tj T* (      DISPLAY leftovers and waste_percent) Tj T* (      IF waste_percent > 15: DISPLAY review alert) Tj T* (END) Tj T* ET
