BT 1 0 0 1 5 86.5 Tm /F4 7 Tf 8.5 TL (BEGIN) Tj T* (  total_fines = 0) Tj T* (  FOR each book record) Tj T* (    IF returned: actual = return_day) Tj T* (    ELSE: actual = current_day) Tj T* (    overdue = max\(0, actual - due_day\)) Tj T* (    fine = overdue * 5) Tj T* (    total_fines = total_fines + fine) Tj T* (    DISPLAY book ID, overdue, fine, status) Tj T* (  DISPLAY total_fines) Tj T* (END) Tj T* ET
