BT 1 0 0 1 5 69.5 Tm /F4 7 Tf 8.5 TL (BEGIN) Tj T* (  FOR each route) Tj T* (    IF passengers < 0 OR buses_available < 0: DISPLAY invalid) Tj T* (    ELSE) Tj T* (      buses_needed = ceiling\(passengers / capacity\)) Tj T* (      available_capacity = buses_available * capacity) Tj T* (      unserved = max\(0, passengers - available_capacity\)) Tj T* (      DISPLAY buses_needed, unserved) Tj T* (END) Tj T* ET
